🚀 Mini-CRM for Telecom & ISP Services
A lightweight, enterprise-ready Mini-CRM designed for Middle East telecom and ISP providers. The platform manages lead prospects, active customer accounts, multi-service subscriptions (Fiber, Mobile, 5G Broadband), bulk Excel ingestion, and proactive agent call schedules.

🏗️ Architecture & Tech Stack
Frontend: React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, TanStack Query, TanStack Table

Backend: Node.js (Express / Fastify) or Python (FastAPI)

Database: PostgreSQL 16+ (Supports native Row-Level Security)

Storage Abstraction: Local Disk, AWS S3, or Azure Blob Storage

Containerization: Docker & Docker Compose with Profile-based deployment

📂 Project Structure
Plaintext
mini-crm/
├── README.md                       # Documentation & Setup Guide
